{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13432","headline":"咏冬瑰花 · 常衮","name":"咏冬瑰花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独鹤寄烟霜，双鸾思晚芳。\n旧阴依谢宅，新艳出萧墙。\n蝶散摇轻露，莺衔入夕阳。\n雨朝胜濯锦，风夜剧焚香。\n丽日千层艳，孤霞一片光。\n密来惊叶少，动处觉枝长。\n布影期高赏，留春爲远方。\n尝闻赠琼玖，叨和愧升堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}